  "body": "## Changelog\n* 6959db75adc8250eb6426f18b1a816a6dc1fd019 Fix handling of missing yaml config file (#595)\n* e6f9b4fd1ce7d489c93c5363636dcc55195947cb Redesign inference usage printer to show chat usage by model (#594)\n* 65ba68e6324f9ddd386afcdd13e9938103245027 Release v3.11.0 #minor\n* b4caeef0e36de8c444531b7e2a38f7bf950beaae Remove deprecated VPC2 commands (#600)\n* 83c6266b225db269a06b5bebb34c23b5b214898c Send CLI diagnostics to stderr instead of stdout (#599)\n* 5e99950fa3c494992eeef3484bdacb807349325c Update govultr from v3.30.0 to v3.31.0 (#592)\n* ea9ecdf41409d899390e45388b0c2664a4060ae7 Update govultr from v3.31.0 to v3.31.1 (#593)\n* 98793a1e6c96d09cc6a9737386b7bad50dc967aa Update govultr from v3.31.1 to v3.32.0 (#597)\n\n"
